<title>UK: SAFA sets A$100 million April 2002 bond.</title>
<headline>SAFA sets A$100 million April 2002 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Hambros.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SOUTH AUSTRALIAN GOVERNMENT FINANCING AUTHORITY</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  TREASURY OF SOUTH AUSTRALIA</p>
<p> AMT    A$100 MLN     COUPON     7.50	MATURITY    15.APR.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.43    PAY DATE    15.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA2/AA    DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/AU</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  AUSTRSLIA TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    050	 SELL CONC  1.50	PRAECIPUUM  0.125</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
